test-results/
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
.vercel

# Vercel's `link` appends a blanket `.env*`, which would also ignore
# apps/web/.env.example -- a file this repo deliberately tracks as the
# documented list of variables the app needs. `.env*.local` above already
# covers the real secrets (and `.dev.vars*` covers the Worker's), so the
# blanket pattern is narrowed to the two names Vercel actually writes.
.env
.env.local
